            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>The transcript search no longer shows a stray native &quot;×&quot; clear button colliding with the match counter (the &quot;×41&quot; clutter). WebKit draws its own clear glyph on every search field; it&#x27;s now hidden so only the clean match-counter + prev/next controls remain.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
